{
    "title": "Olympics: Live Sports & News",
    "description": "Follow the Olympic journey with the Olympics app. Go behind the curtain with exclusive coverage of your favourite sports, athletes and events. Stay up-to-date with original series, breaking news, podcasts, and live streams of Olympic qualifying events. Your personal companion to the Olympic and Paralympic Games awaits.\r\n\r\n<b>With the Olympics app, you can: </b>\r\n\r\n\u2022 <b>GET EXCLUSIVE ACCESS:</b> discover in-depth insights into Olympic events, breaking news, and watch live sports.\r\n\u2022 <b>WATCH OLYMPIC QUALIFIERS:</b> don\u2019t miss any action, see events live from the app! \r\n\u2022 <b>CUSTOMISE YOUR EXPERIENCE:</b> add all your favourite Olympic events, teams and athletes for insider access straight from the source. \r\n\r\nWhether you\u2019re keeping up with the Qualifiers, interested in the stories behind events like the Torch Relay and ceremonies, or simply want to learn more about the Olympic Games \u2013 the Olympics app is the perfect companion. \r\n\r\n<b>SCHEDULES & RESULTS </b>\r\n\r\nStay on top of all the Olympic events. Our handy reminders help you know when the events that you are interested in are taking place. \r\n\r\n<b>OLYMPIC QUALIFIERS</b>\r\n\r\nWatch the Olympic Qualifiers live, straight from the app. From skateboarding to freestyle skiing and gymnastics, there are plenty of new and exciting events to see. Follow your favourite athletes or discover emerging talents!\r\n\r\n<b>MINUTE-BY-MINUTE UPDATES </b>\r\n\r\nIt\u2019s hard to stay on top of everything that\u2019s going on at the Olympics! The Olympics app allows you to stay updated with minute-by-minute news on all your favourite events. \r\n\r\n<b>CUSTOMISED FEED</b>\r\n\r\nCreate a customised experience by adding all your favourite Olympic events, teams and athletes. That way, you can enjoy content and updates that cater to your Olympic interests. \r\n\r\n<b>PODCASTS & NEWS </b>\r\n\r\nListen to curated Olympic podcasts that inspire and motivate the athlete in all of us. You\u2019ll find the most in-depth sports coverage right here on the app, as well as an exclusive look behind the scenes. \r\n\r\n\u2014------------------------------ \r\n\r\nThe app content is available in English, Japanese, Chinese, French, Hindi, Korean, Portuguese, German, Italian, Russian and Spanish. Please refer to our terms and condition and privacy policy for additional terms.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Follow the Olympic journey with the Olympics app. Go behind the curtain with exclusive coverage of your favourite sports, athletes and events. Stay up-to-date with original series, breaking news, podcasts, and live streams of Olympic qualifying events. Your personal companion to the Olympic and Paralympic Games awaits.<br><br><b>With the Olympics app, you can: </b><br><br>\u2022 <b>GET EXCLUSIVE ACCESS:</b> discover in-depth insights into Olympic events, breaking news, and watch live sports.<br>\u2022 <b>WATCH OLYMPIC QUALIFIERS:</b> don\u2019t miss any action, see events live from the app! <br>\u2022 <b>CUSTOMISE YOUR EXPERIENCE:</b> add all your favourite Olympic events, teams and athletes for insider access straight from the source. <br><br>Whether you\u2019re keeping up with the Qualifiers, interested in the stories behind events like the Torch Relay and ceremonies, or simply want to learn more about the Olympic Games \u2013 the Olympics app is the perfect companion. <br><br><b>SCHEDULES &amp; RESULTS </b><br><br>Stay on top of all the Olympic events. Our handy reminders help you know when the events that you are interested in are taking place. <br><br><b>OLYMPIC QUALIFIERS</b><br><br>Watch the Olympic Qualifiers live, straight from the app. From skateboarding to freestyle skiing and gymnastics, there are plenty of new and exciting events to see. Follow your favourite athletes or discover emerging talents!<br><br><b>MINUTE-BY-MINUTE UPDATES </b><br><br>It\u2019s hard to stay on top of everything that\u2019s going on at the Olympics! The Olympics app allows you to stay updated with minute-by-minute news on all your favourite events. <br><br><b>CUSTOMISED FEED</b><br><br>Create a customised experience by adding all your favourite Olympic events, teams and athletes. That way, you can enjoy content and updates that cater to your Olympic interests. <br><br><b>PODCASTS &amp; NEWS </b><br><br>Listen to curated Olympic podcasts that inspire and motivate the athlete in all of us. You\u2019ll find the most in-depth sports coverage right here on the app, as well as an exclusive look behind the scenes. <br><br>\u2014------------------------------ <br><br>The app content is available in English, Japanese, Chinese, French, Hindi, Korean, Portuguese, German, Italian, Russian and Spanish. Please refer to our terms and condition and privacy policy for additional terms.",
